{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：人物动机和段落之间的因果关系不如 Y 交代得充分，部分感受词也略显密集、重复。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的关键词放大加亮，话与感受交替呈现，扫屏时更容易迅速抓住每段核心；尤其是到时出现的感受词，能跟音乐具体节点对应，边听边看有更强的即时体验。X 的感受描写也更有层次，能呈现情绪和音乐细微变化，而不是只给一个概括性标签。Y 的优势是人物动机解释得更充分，前后因果更连贯，但较长的叙述句会占用听音乐时的阅读注意力，综合而言我选 X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6e935c41-8f62-4540-a6e7-e7034640867a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T234941975033Z", "elapsed_seconds": 76.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T23:50:58.404652+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e74a7e3a071a31366484413879596ad26effeaea9b648a21e66a3da6306ffdf3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238